@RemsToRems_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5269

### Patient lookup
POST {{RemsToRems_Api_HostAddress}}/api/patient/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "applicationName": "REMS",
  "environment": "DEV",
  "organization": "<client name>",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "dateOfBirth": "1980-01-31",
  "zip5": "12345"
}

### Validation error (expect 400)
POST {{RemsToRems_Api_HostAddress}}/api/patient/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "environment": "DEV"
}
